ering if you could draw my OC?\n\nHer name is Ruby Battenberg she is a Leopard Gyaru girl based on a Battenberg cake she's flirty and likes to party.\n\nCould you draw her in a cabin/treehouse bed with a jungle behind her? Pick her out some cute lingerie, or you can use the refrence sheet or design your own up to you.\n\nplease could you draw it 6,900 x 9,900 pixels in size if possible.\n\nThankyou for taking your time to read my request.\n\nhttps://x.com/BlackroseRuby66/status/1939457800490434826", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yofo32858840/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1169878, "client_id": 120758, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c284176e/uploads/origins/22e8d6ab-618e-4b69-ac5f-06c1c31b1c74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd96e654d2efbc51732937782c794cb6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c284176e/uploads/origins/22e8d6ab-618e-4b69-ac5f-06c1c31b1c74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd96e654d2efbc51732937782c794cb6, https://si.imgix.net/c284176e/uploads/origins/22e8d6ab-618e-4b69-ac5f-06c1c31b1c74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=702ba1d70726836d5723880a5b6a63d2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c284176e/uploads/origins/22e8d6ab-618e-4b69-ac5f-06c1c31b1c74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e41bc415fae35a230dd3e1398a2b7a5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c284176e/uploads/origins/22e8d6ab-618e-4b69-ac5f-06c1c31b1c74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1ffe15104a2e463e727b003e2bf7610e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c284176e/uploads/origins/22e8d6ab-618e-4b69-ac5f-06c1c31b1c74?bg=%23